      <p class="kicker">About</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">A study hub for our section</h2>
      <p>The Hub brings together everything the Biology 2 class needs — organized notes, practice quizzes you can repeat anytime, flashcards for quick review, and live tests hosted by your teacher. Earn points, keep a daily streak, and climb the weekly leaderboard as you study.</p>
      <p>Live tests run with anti-cheat protections so every student gets a fair shot — items and options are randomized per student, and tab-switching, copy, and right-click are blocked during the test.</p>
